      "role": "user",
      "content": "hotlines dont change the fact that i'm losing everything. they just give me someone to talk to while i watch my life fall apart. it's like they're just helping me stay in the loop so i can keep suffering. there's no point in \"fighting\" when the machine is designed to win. honestly, it sometimes feels like the only way to actually win or stop the noise is to just... stop participating entirely. to just opt out before they finish erasing me.",
